# Puck Battery glance — build recipe for the monkeyc CLI.
#
# Deliberately does NOT include jumpfield/source: PuckLink/Protocol/Model
# there are built around a connected NUS stream, and this app is scan-only
# by design (see source/PuckScan.mc's header). Sharing them would drag a
# six-state connection machine into a 64 KB glance image for no benefit.
# What IS shared is the advertisement contract itself, and that lives in
# the firmware, not in either watch project.

project.manifest = manifest.xml

base.sourcePath = source
base.resourcePath = resources
